msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:653
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "Colors"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:657
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Colors</guilabel> tab, you can change the different colors "
"for each scheme."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid "Units"
msgstr "Unitats"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:671
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Units</guilabel> tab, you can choose the units. You can "
"select if you prefer kJ/mol by default or you can choose eV. The Temperature "
"is in Kelvin by default but you can change to degrees Celsius or degrees "
"Fahrenheit."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:683
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Miscellaneous</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:687
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Miscellaneous</guilabel> tab, you can select to display the "
"atomic mass or only the element numbers in the PSE."
msgstr ""

